  "name": "Death's Friend",
  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your association with death has become so close that you gain the following benefits:</p><ul><li>When you use your Wails from the Grave, you can deal the necrotic damage to both the first and the second creature.</li><li>When you roll initiative, you regain one soul trinket.</li><li>You also ignore Resistance to necrotic damage from your Wails from the Grave feature and treat Immunity to it as Resistance instead.</li></ul>",
